eir budgets and technical resources allow them to do remains wide. We are building OlmoEarth to help close it. More from this author What building Shippy taught us about building agents 19 July 15, 2026 DiScoFormer: One transformer for density and score, across distributions 6 June 29, 2026 Community Mikeleton 8 days ago very cool, thanks for sharing Reply Steetvan23 7 days ago This sounds like an interesting approach to making geospatial AI more accessible for organizations that may not have large engineering teams. It’s encouraging to see work focused on practical environmental applications such as wildfire monitoring, conservation, and disaster response at a larger operational scale. Reply Steetvan23 6 days ago Solutions that reduce technical barriers can make advanced tools more useful for nonprofits, public agencies, and research groups that need practical results rather than complex infrastructure. Reply Edit Preview Upload images, audio, and videos by dragging in the text input, pasting, or clicking here . Tap or paste here to upload images Comment · Sign up or log in to comment Upvote 39 +27",
